{"_comment": "Fidelity gold set. One JSON object per line. kind = sentence | argument | decline. Every tfl string is verified to parse, and every argument's verdict is verified against the engine, by test/test_fidelity_set.ml. also_ok lists alternate formalizations judged equally faithful — recorded so scoring does not punish a defensible structural choice. See data/fidelity/README.md."}
